.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、お稽古前に飲み物を買っていきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レジで「ストロー付けてください」ってお願いして、買い物を終え、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"袋をあけたらスプーンがついていました。\nあの、スイーツ食べる用の小さいスプーンです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こ、これは一体..............."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジュースを目の前に、立ちはだかる壁。（ ¯•ω•¯ ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしや私は試されているのか...？（何を）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新制服です！どぉーん！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/06/14/0845131/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏が一番すき(﹡ˆˆ﹡)♡ "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな季節早く来いっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"  ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだは、横浜で個別握手会でした( *ˆoˆ* )有難うございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの皆さんが横断幕を作ってくださって、飾ってあって嬉しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆのレーンに来たときは、ぜひみなさん、見ていってね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\nさゆレンジャー参上！でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型レポ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/06/14/0845131/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部＊  ストレート"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/06/14/0845131/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部＊  ツイン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部＊  サイドポニー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/say